      "value": "https://vpm.nadena.dev/vpm.json\n\nhttps://vpm.anatawa12.com/vpm.json\n\nhttps://lilxyzw.github.io/vpm-repos/vpm.json\n\nThese are commonly used tools in Japan\n\nUserRepo from modular avatar (VRCFury without \"NSFW elements\", for example), anatawa tools (optimization tools), and  liltoon (shaders).\n\nThese have been registered from VPMCLI by launching CMD, but being able to register them in VCC from a browser would be a great help to non-wizards who don't understand the CLI.\n\nHowever, it seems to me that the bug of the registered UserRepo not showing up should be fixed first.\n\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/creator-companion-beta/p/bug-vcc2-repolist-is-not-loaded",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
